# Charged ollie, FS Shove-It (Right, then Right with J: THPS 2's double-direction slot, which THPS 1+2
# keeps; it was J + up, J before 2026-11-16, and J + up J is now a Double Impossible) right after the pop:
# the flip finishes and the combo lands (the view's flip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap right 92
tap flip+right 96
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=FS Shove-It} within 97..97
expect no event trickStart{trick=Heelflip}
expect event trickEnd{trick=FS Shove-It} within 120..175
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Shove-It,points=150} within 160..240
expect no event bail
